    <artifactId>babel</artifactId>

    <!-- The foreign system: an ISBN service that is not ours. This module stands in for
         the vendor's client library; in a real system it would be a jar from their
         repository and its one method would make an HTTP call. Here it answers from a
         table, but its model is theirs: a record with the fields they chose, the
         names they chose, an ISBN with no hyphens, authors surname first with a role
         in brackets, and a null where they have nothing to say. Its package is not
         library.anything, because the library did not write it. It depends on
         nothing in the project, and nothing in the project depends on it but the
         Anti-Corruption Layer and the configurators that hand it to one. It has no
         tests, because one does not test the vendor's jar. -->
</project>
